{
  "schemaVersion": "tts-segment-manifest@1.0",
  "projectId": "75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657",
  "narrationPlanArtifact": "e39bed7d-f3d9-423a-ade9-2f237df8b758@1",
  "inputNarrationArtifact": "3e02dda8-5805-4857-8ec2-1f0fa4b896e9@2",
  "inputPlaintextSha256": "bc85e2ce7da55150e3c6c327c37f9663d36b4afbe9f8474c67247aca5721917f",
  "provider": "indextts2",
  "voice": "xlbnas@1",
  "segmentCount": 60,
  "paragraphsCovered": 24,
  "sourceTextCoverage": "100%",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_index": 1,
      "unit_id": "N001",
      "paragraph_id": "P01",
      "source_text": "晚上十一点，项目还没做完。继续熬夜，能换来进度，却要从睡眠里拿走时间，也可能错过和家人的相处。",
      "source_text_sha256": "bf86966e05e315a0416678ddce371ccff6be886c2f5fb1ab19939cfcb538f649",
      "character_count": 47,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N001-d60314fa-bdc5-4c67-a4da-3e61da7c6f8d.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0e8670858e0090cd3e9a57ed9871db5b473f85801f8a15634f15537acea53e16",
      "duration_seconds": 10.403,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 2,
      "unit_id": "N002",
      "paragraph_id": "P01",
      "source_text": "我们常说事业、健康、家庭和自由都重要。一次冲突未必说明全部，但长期重复的选择，会慢慢写出真实排序。",
      "source_text_sha256": "f420ba947b631963bad07ec98ccb61c9a184aaf733e0d3d28b381079db351588",
      "character_count": 49,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N002-ca11b145-521c-4678-94a0-e4ae8d0dd1b1.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e045286e2b43f4b4c30c262860bb30bec1409c70e1710e86fc9659521dd32b78",
      "duration_seconds": 10.635,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 3,
      "unit_id": "N003",
      "paragraph_id": "P02",
      "source_text": "死亡带来的不是对结尾的恐吓，而是一个朴素限制：生命有限，时间不可逆。死亡使时间成为稀缺资源，而稀缺迫使选择出现。",
      "source_text_sha256": "825c44004df1e4e7d824c9e74e5c3e647f3fb09e0c08edf9bb24629023b96eac",
      "character_count": 56,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N003-cb5dad9c-ca03-43c1-99ee-8ea43bef6cd1.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "eee6dca6e4b17dbe832f3ef9926e2ef5d52b935106d0317ac777ebe53728c98b",
      "duration_seconds": 12.655,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 4,
      "unit_id": "N004",
      "paragraph_id": "P02",
      "source_text": "每答应一件事，就会同时拒绝另一些可能。不过，这不等于每一分钟都必须有产出。",
      "source_text_sha256": "161912d42e190856eefddb1277b48f3d3e969ecb2566b79c90434313de8391d8",
      "character_count": 37,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N004-7a4c8779-1a21-487b-8d3d-e53eda64b74e.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2deff982923bb17182663ee219379b75b47115e4edc6b0fe29d417e4e15d6d85",
      "duration_seconds": 8.104,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 5,
      "unit_id": "N005",
      "paragraph_id": "P02",
      "source_text": "休息、闲聊、发呆，也可以是愿意认领的生活。真正的问题是：下一单位生命，准备分配到哪里？",
      "source_text_sha256": "11180aa9a2b45030f7065c4b2a9e2527cd168f4143fc6009a0967bf0f6e274fd",
      "character_count": 43,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N005-13a1b7a6-0357-477a-bf0b-740aa231de4e.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ce0438aaf36afb7cff2568f920512b24f162b28ed8db4db28199a5e8b6b0cc51",
      "duration_seconds": 10.263,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 6,
      "unit_id": "N006",
      "paragraph_id": "P03",
      "source_text": "这个问题没有宇宙预先写好的标准答案。世界似乎没有给每个人附上任务说明，告诉我们从事什么工作、爱谁、完成什么，才算通过人生。",
      "source_text_sha256": "16caa31bc8c2f8ac43ff559cc352487a681e5213a033759d52370f68dd6cb94f",
      "character_count": 61,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N006-33a77619-234b-4a16-8838-f1b4c0761f25.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ff10e2d2ad6c00631ce44c6d39e3841e8eca3db9c1eefe63448cc3e839e19f07",
      "duration_seconds": 12.214,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 7,
      "unit_id": "N007",
      "paragraph_id": "P03",
      "source_text": "但没有外部规定的目的，不能推出一切选择都没有差别，也不能推出有意识的生命无法产生真实意义。",
      "source_text_sha256": "bb7aaff82cc8c1e85d5915209772d5dfd61bf4af9915620fbe22ccc5026759a7",
      "character_count": 45,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N007-1df01e90-a871-46f9-8467-6e78d852db13.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "980e8d378b5611092f722a357a5fc116544376e0839fb5c7c7c353a09f7e6eeb",
      "duration_seconds": 8.858,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 8,
      "unit_id": "N008",
      "paragraph_id": "P04",
      "source_text": "一段关系、一项事业或一种生活方式，都由人来理解和赋值。可人为产生，不等于虚假；",
      "source_text_sha256": "d4c1a6a13f6822b6f7c38d72949de660e64fc1a805892aaeaa01d2a96d45074c",
      "character_count": 39,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N008-042bd531-6020-4366-9c49-e63194a28756.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d37911cd2b52e1c65e7a7245edb22068f7ff8dfd83ccb853cc05ed0107553e50",
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 9,
      "unit_id": "N009",
      "paragraph_id": "P04",
      "source_text": "主观相关，也不等于任意。法律、承诺和货币依赖人的共同理解，却能真实改变行动。",
      "source_text_sha256": "02e8aa8685cfca962e84215553e069dad9c406049c605bff696385098d64cee8",
      "character_count": 38,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N009-37be2fec-10d8-4060-8a48-39b9b42f8192.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7bd02ef7b28b9b8e80e3710789820a5efa896878ff4b06a753f9246150988c2a",
      "duration_seconds": 8.162,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 10,
      "unit_id": "N010",
      "paragraph_id": "P04",
      "source_text": "意义也一样：它会改变时间和注意力的去向，并在价值冲突时要求人承担代价。",
      "source_text_sha256": "f6a9f84c09e77f723f98e320306e774396318ae6e3c4de32bc586c9f7f65ca41",
      "character_count": 35,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N010-ece5fe64-b4b7-439d-856b-0ea495b8cf87.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d400a933f5dd32c550c56a88bb948f5f178b51d630ba80bbcf6b1aeb54b76889",
      "duration_seconds": 8.104,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 11,
      "unit_id": "N011",
      "paragraph_id": "P05",
      "source_text": "嘴上说家人重要并不困难。更能说明问题的，是工作机会和陪伴冲突时，那个晚上交给了哪里。",
      "source_text_sha256": "9034d02d9e6b5f7f16f364cacdb584c3885b02c262e4a719226cf321b79d43bc",
      "character_count": 42,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N011-1a6e50a5-0eee-4453-b4f2-005b6d41147d.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "cbac774ca7539232550980a15e5455663e43bd411fc3d8514ecf9a4e2b02f8c7",
      "duration_seconds": 8.998,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 12,
      "unit_id": "N012",
      "paragraph_id": "P05",
      "source_text": "只在语言里重要、从不改变资源分配的价值，有时更像身份装饰。更现实的目标不是等宇宙替我写好任务，而是判断哪些意义值得认领。",
      "source_text_sha256": "0e08d4059bad7fe1cc0c46f99a7d34df5a464c9223b71f7bb61b1afe1bb4610c",
      "character_count": 60,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N012-616bf79d-41a1-4f82-87c8-540cf80465ea.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ae0eeefb2eeceb0d09799e8b52303d913c292853d16f79f5ba02db302f3c9131",
      "duration_seconds": 11.598,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 13,
      "unit_id": "N013",
      "paragraph_id": "P05",
      "source_text": "可这是否意味着，“我想要”已经是充分理由？",
      "source_text_sha256": "baca66f429137fca62c9be0c9eeaccba45e2995dac24e14bb27f991dfb40c794",
      "character_count": 21,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N013-2958298f-2177-41b3-b62f-bbebe1b1b6c6.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7dfe185d5be95cc91f37e433711ce849439afff489ba652c7016e478cc5546d8",
      "duration_seconds": 4.725,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 14,
      "unit_id": "N014",
      "paragraph_id": "P06",
      "source_text": "未必。欲望可以很强烈，却未必清楚地告诉我们，它真正想购买什么。",
      "source_text_sha256": "2e64ec0ead7ff96b052b79864e4d5dcdca837ab7bce0664b144755d0fe41efca",
      "character_count": 31,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N014-7b044fea-07d2-4111-ac6f-0142e2473de5.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "69c69421fe056a70bddeab02128ff50af9b470ed332291fcc450478bc5136b02",
      "duration_seconds": 7.082,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 15,
      "unit_id": "N015",
      "paragraph_id": "P06",
      "source_text": "比如想买一辆车。表面上买的是一件物品，背后可能有驾驶体验、通勤便利，也可能有被看见的期待、比较后的不甘，或者对某种身份的想象。",
      "source_text_sha256": "cb96dc51826a62cc30be0f3d3646eac0f2502a81f32bc8bd73d17ed309b04519",
      "character_count": 63,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N015-5b9b549e-4f3b-4cce-bd0c-5ebe2794452f.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "f72b027f31c7762719da56da1215eebb81e28cfab4a785bd902e40a9a09f7186",
      "duration_seconds": 12.179,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 16,
      "unit_id": "N016",
      "paragraph_id": "P06",
      "source_text": "这些来源都很真实，但它们需要被分开看。",
      "source_text_sha256": "0fe72f1debd2b5e42d12c9478d8036b354dac609533ffa25d6be08576b4b41cb",
      "character_count": 19,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N016-3a97ca0f-d638-4640-ab22-51a3f0be7317.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "26ba29cf61231d52e7b5c45dbe3f09e91a0b30e701373359c81b8e17aedc6c63",
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 17,
      "unit_id": "N017",
      "paragraph_id": "P07",
      "source_text": "至少可以做三个检查。先拿掉观众：如果永远没有人知道我买了它，我还想要多少？",
      "source_text_sha256": "bd913f10b75a3987fd13a6820331cf16a938a6d2a91715fd901df973f1b2deed",
      "character_count": 37,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N017-35946898-ccf0-4139-93d9-b36571d5a536.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "cfbf9766486ddeea18929916486b8e812bdeab6dbeac18f57c18425b216bf3eb",
      "duration_seconds": 8.336,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 18,
      "unit_id": "N018",
      "paragraph_id": "P07",
      "source_text": "再把交付那天的兴奋拉长：我迷恋的是得到的一刻，还是愿意过拥有以后大量的普通星期二，包括保养、停车、支出和日常使用？最后看它留下什么：它会扩大未来的行动空间，还是让我越来越依赖同一种刺激和同一种评价？",
      "source_text_sha256": "9811cd06574700cb2b579fd31d86748ba72943da54345475e0a410ed519c9e9c",
      "character_count": 99,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N018-307b4618-f95f-47bc-9252-00d02349af67.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c5f9b88949c83365a51ab6eb8f50b700bbdf7e1609d26dde5cf5a10745c16e5a",
      "duration_seconds": 20.622,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 19,
      "unit_id": "N019",
      "paragraph_id": "P08",
      "source_text": "发现虚荣、比较、身份或补偿，并不等于这个欲望自动无效。人很难拥有完全纯净、毫无社会来源的愿望。",
      "source_text_sha256": "f34422eb0490b944ff9e5bd7bf80923b2b424856652501740725499032ace8f1",
      "character_count": 47,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N019-d04194c9-a880-4ee5-ae41-6e1cb1a9f49f.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "9748a212ae6b041578457f3928f6bf5c577c33c5ca2e0a08b93de38eb7e73134",
      "duration_seconds": 9.741,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 20,
      "unit_id": "N020",
      "paragraph_id": "P08",
      "source_text": "审计的目的不是消灭欲望，也不是把消费本身当成错误，而是看清自己究竟在买什么，再判断为它支付的真实价格是否合理。购买对象看清以后，下一步还要问：这笔账是在今天付清，还是被留给了未来？",
      "source_text_sha256": "fe60e261081e4e59c00cec8e7120af2d91b19bad40ed83808ebb590b5f23c7cb",
      "character_count": 90,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N020-be092b56-44e4-4cae-bad0-94aaaf5fa9be.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "5f93cfe8db5ae39d0ed3f4abe1851da8fc59fcf8d667d461805167cbae168cf6",
      "duration_seconds": 17.894,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 21,
      "unit_id": "N021",
      "paragraph_id": "P09",
      "source_text": "很多决定都像跨时间交易。现在的我拥有签字权，未来的我继承结果。",
      "source_text_sha256": "7fdb7e9605b127e2280c7f207e127d071b08a3c16fae017a1164493e890028f1",
      "character_count": 31,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N021-6479c705-af69-4faf-ba09-3ca5942fe61e.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7bd432c05716989b287438ea9ce1bc0526a6a48347fe5c833257d3190d126bc1",
      "duration_seconds": 7.488,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 22,
      "unit_id": "N022",
      "paragraph_id": "P09",
      "source_text": "今晚熬夜，明天的身体接单；今天不处理关系裂痕，后来双方承担距离扩大的成本。",
      "source_text_sha256": "01f018602b5d81542ab44ac5aa81554762820c301e7410fafef57b398d9ec50f",
      "character_count": 37,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N022-775b2be0-bad1-4947-8f6b-8d5721ba2b38.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "f11271ec7ab84f3d82654434e27a243baaaba0e8b9558103058a2a8d9a31396f",
      "duration_seconds": 7.779,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 23,
      "unit_id": "N023",
      "paragraph_id": "P09",
      "source_text": "但时间伦理不能倒向另一个极端。未来的我不是唯一股东，现在的我也有资格获得快乐、休息和真实生活，不能永远被当成建设未来的工具。",
      "source_text_sha256": "3577373f491ab001cd0877f2b572ddccbe8047fdb1ad56d48667130a130b196c",
      "character_count": 62,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N023-6107365b-da2b-4291-a7ad-be08f446b547.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d0d9ddd08698eb011a573a2957cce6a4e1043378bfe9f24206d7af289fe973b4",
      "duration_seconds": 12.794,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 24,
      "unit_id": "N024",
      "paragraph_id": "P10",
      "source_text": "真正要判断的，是事情在时间里怎样变化。有些问题利率很高。",
      "source_text_sha256": "cecafecd4a601dd12b1fcb30b62933aa0a1c806e98893689d92078478f1a3fd5",
      "character_count": 28,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N024-2f20b0c7-ea3c-4f8b-a747-c6e8639bcda4.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "04b773125d6858914a8417bddbe52efecb191f0db038300655d392a70cbe6618",
      "duration_seconds": 7.105,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 25,
      "unit_id": "N025",
      "paragraph_id": "P10",
      "source_text": "身体已经发出警报、技术债持续堆积、关系裂痕被沉默覆盖，拖延不会让它们停在原价，反而让修复越来越贵。有些投入则会复利。",
      "source_text_sha256": "701d2920a6eb5e2d0631ea0cf4839dd9c7bf2a00a88cb6708bb9df10168d7396",
      "character_count": 58,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N025-0058543b-f4b7-477a-8cda-9193d7a40bcc.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "be78fe317a09a51e56fea93b65677e4525f93c0bcfccd8ac99b06189ceaa1f98",
      "duration_seconds": 12.574,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 26,
      "unit_id": "N026",
      "paragraph_id": "P10",
      "source_text": "能力、健康习惯和信誉越早形成，越能参与后面的选择。",
      "source_text_sha256": "9dd5d1071e4a5f9590ee1717fc8d8eba898a8dcaff3a0b442f94ad090179e4b2",
      "character_count": 25,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N026-5f19b4b1-a3b2-478d-9700-003a2e8f60ea.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2f5bc7e3b924a4f7ca5f42a9893214c2edc350c76c6686440ee86bac1bd2d322",
      "duration_seconds": 6.908,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 27,
      "unit_id": "N027",
      "paragraph_id": "P11",
      "source_text": "也有事情可以等待。信息不足、情绪正在峰值时，暂缓决定可能减少冲动和错误，晚一点并不会明显损失价值。",
      "source_text_sha256": "d9063aca29438aa9a6a9059b8a57a8d1379faee1570ceda2e8444ed5277143f8",
      "character_count": 49,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N027-eb8fb30d-a6d3-479a-91e3-ea69ca3ec1f6.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "bbe73817aad85119734fe74a2566017df2eb73dc82ada556c4aa48ebbc52e01b",
      "duration_seconds": 10.913,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 28,
      "unit_id": "N028",
      "paragraph_id": "P11",
      "source_text": "另一些却有窗口：父母仍健康、彼此还能一起行动的时间，或某个生命阶段才能原样拥有的体验，一旦错过，以后有更多钱也未必能买回来。",
      "source_text_sha256": "be7968e68a233c132af9467d1eb89f87c4bed1cebddcbd8d4436f09dba45f7be",
      "character_count": 62,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N028-71691169-c91a-4fff-9a45-f67345e02a0e.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "76b364673b6066a4d806b9f1fd024c902f136b0139327834da1b9cdad82bf61b",
      "duration_seconds": 12.353,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 29,
      "unit_id": "N029",
      "paragraph_id": "P12",
      "source_text": "因此，“以后再说”不是一个免费的按钮。它可能积累利息、错过复利，也可能值得等待，或正在放走会关闭的窗口。",
      "source_text_sha256": "a7cf873529d99c0a11eb86559a0435c28bbec0a676fe1a73ebe4c98a47bfa04a",
      "character_count": 52,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N029-3e095e55-cfec-471a-8d10-1a1749aac132.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ff8e62fc69d9311654dc13be6bff3a17925fba25d059861fb0286fed2a98af2f",
      "duration_seconds": 10.461,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 30,
      "unit_id": "N030",
      "paragraph_id": "P12",
      "source_text": "该复利的，让它尽早复利；会过期的，不要无限延期。",
      "source_text_sha256": "9ad6b149b35ddacab848002e61e9772ae4bb9603665d82f82bf9de438ad727b6",
      "character_count": 24,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N030-c39718aa-2639-4856-8e05-39db5f1c2ec8.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4c743e22ce5c22faf5a2a025b2d9ba618e45d789c45709cd62a1ee7c23e288ce",
      "duration_seconds": 6.629,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 31,
      "unit_id": "N031",
      "paragraph_id": "P12",
      "source_text": "理解利率，不是把人生变成财务公式，而是承认时间会改变价格。既然时间交易有价格，吃苦和坚持也不能只看还能不能扛。",
      "source_text_sha256": "d2863b5a78c4d9fb3b06a5e863075f2069ab7f298f224a016725813dfeea72d7",
      "character_count": 55,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N031-2a9d455b-b1cb-4df5-9dca-453bc98c8310.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b93c0e831d625898fcddcd8f918653d8cbdc65ac7eb25bce66786595f7741ad8",
      "duration_seconds": 12.376,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 32,
      "unit_id": "N032",
      "paragraph_id": "P13",
      "source_text": "有些痛苦确实在购买未来。训练换来适应，学习留下能力，建设期也可能形成作品或自由。",
      "source_text_sha256": "1f9004b01f3390529d16e189759328a2ee4068e6543460c69001ebf0c7a1f02f",
      "character_count": 40,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N032-63ea0a5a-b9a6-4a0f-bb39-bb15b3c8558b.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "49efb5a02c8c8c6696194cb4c6577a742a6b06bb7225c296d44c2ca61f1df2c5",
      "duration_seconds": 9.555,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 33,
      "unit_id": "N033",
      "paragraph_id": "P13",
      "source_text": "但痛苦本身不是价值证明。判断是否值得，要问：目标还值得吗，路径还有可信证据吗，它在购买什么，又准备何时、怎样兑现？",
      "source_text_sha256": "5570e669798ab2e25f1fbcdca54276629330f0e9050c3073190bd1321eebd338",
      "character_count": 57,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N033-65cf8430-3b85-40d5-b5bb-f01d9e08f270.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "cf885c4c7c8f960ab0ff21ac963a3de89dd053b2b78fe41a2961ea691dbe2c92",
      "duration_seconds": 12.156,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 34,
      "unit_id": "N034",
      "paragraph_id": "P14",
      "source_text": "还要看成本是否开始摧毁负责兑现目标的系统。长期失眠可能先削弱做事业所需的判断力；",
      "source_text_sha256": "fa86fcb01823dfc8681bf0ead80ffdc4a3645529f79dffccd95713152fa54a87",
      "character_count": 40,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N034-8f650775-e7f9-4bf6-9e30-22273948a2f1.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0c51e502db621e3b5fe79c4bbcac04dec68380dfb38fab680b8a89d543b5d84c",
      "duration_seconds": 9.323,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 35,
      "unit_id": "N035",
      "paragraph_id": "P14",
      "source_text": "长期压抑可能耗尽关系中的沟通和善意。能承受，不等于有义务一直承受。",
      "source_text_sha256": "0ae18129ad269b767f0380b2390ce7cfb79adcb341f70a87d44e974c0a53165e",
      "character_count": 33,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N035-04864ebf-f928-4fcd-a08f-cbe0d5684451.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ad715d401d954ca60f2597e72e46c60b875302d00e0eb28aae8722171bb07485",
      "duration_seconds": 7.779,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 36,
      "unit_id": "N036",
      "paragraph_id": "P14",
      "source_text": "你能扛一百公斤，不意味着应该没事一直背着一百公斤走。不过，当前难受不自动等于纯粹损耗，前期没有回报，也不能单独证明路线失败。",
      "source_text_sha256": "d161977719037d3e88796ca8dc64ec60b305053ec9d19dcdf8f1e95a7dab2f32",
      "character_count": 62,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N036-835a38b6-570f-4bba-8c8a-0cd091932ff8.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "9171de67ad4af1200ff7332e6143b8beb87af089e0b3c26e21e15d557f568646",
      "duration_seconds": 13.479,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 37,
      "unit_id": "N037",
      "paragraph_id": "P15",
      "source_text": "痛苦持续得越久，过去越容易要求未来替它证明。一个项目已经做了五年，继续不会让过去五年复活，只会决定下一单位生命是否还要投入。",
      "source_text_sha256": "d5b17be7ff07bfd2648c65ee7a68b92a2777ccf1b35157d60127b0e9f852d7dc",
      "character_count": 62,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N037-91369b60-78c5-4ad7-95d3-411ca2bedc3a.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "70f636fbf466ed79896732f68bb0f213cec1a23f435a72650f74a6013fa46a8d",
      "duration_seconds": 12.492,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 38,
      "unit_id": "N038",
      "paragraph_id": "P15",
      "source_text": "过去形成的能力、资产、客户、关系、经验和约束仍在，它们改变了今天的起点，也应该进入判断。",
      "source_text_sha256": "b30b51dc185c635ada320a052ba283aa1f92ad68c16ea6d4fb7b60b1d7a9336f",
      "character_count": 44,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N038-b47703e7-7f26-41a6-a3c6-065b45f01e4f.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e03948a798dddd380d96d22af3869395219133684fb28ce780a91ed1acb02c3b",
      "duration_seconds": 9.857,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 39,
      "unit_id": "N039",
      "paragraph_id": "P16",
      "source_text": "但“过去留下有效资产”和“过去已经付出，所以未来必须继续”，不是一回事。过去负责提供信息，不能只凭已付成本替未来投票。",
      "source_text_sha256": "ab325d652ffadafa754867a69c403422840faa928e5732b9bf3fb5508f9993ed",
      "character_count": 59,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N039-123a5842-ee60-4220-9006-5e17488940aa.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "fd0e2353a0eda0f6341e1324bf4fc2f2cd5b83de26d9c9c22c516809adc01a4b",
      "duration_seconds": 11.738,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 40,
      "unit_id": "N040",
      "paragraph_id": "P16",
      "source_text": "问题是：从今天出发，不再为过去辩护，下一单位投入还值得吗？答案可能是继续，也可能是退出。",
      "source_text_sha256": "aa0a885d5399d346ab358ee5115a79b3e0289e848a27332fadf13eb5228996f9",
      "character_count": 44,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N040-ae57253f-87e2-4ba0-bd27-88182b9a8cc2.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "41a71fa57722e97b05b7755b11881b7477b971137a96414c45093c7dc8718c68",
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 41,
      "unit_id": "N041",
      "paragraph_id": "P16",
      "source_text": "退出不自动更成熟，坚持也不自动更正确。要避开两个极端，既需要退出权，也需要承诺。",
      "source_text_sha256": "ee2272e1dd0a3672cb059de6b0a580f01ce2ac5ea26198836eeeb7157cdb8b03",
      "character_count": 40,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N041-fec361fa-50b2-4ed3-8673-c8e5d4468dac.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "5802e757f7ac96e4e8ef66cab20f9bad4231a0d61bbe56a61fbbd01694a47850",
      "duration_seconds": 9.242,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 42,
      "unit_id": "N042",
      "paragraph_id": "P17",
      "source_text": "选择权太少，人可能被一条已经失效的路线锁住；选择权太多，又可能永远比较、永远试用，什么都无法积累。",
      "source_text_sha256": "b9c825610a2690c6153c31b54ae064e457a74ac08af9394466539426ef461490",
      "character_count": 49,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N042-983d75b0-4612-43ef-a881-6793047b3e33.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0ac6a0cb62f790441e9ed4bb6305e293b0cc501365d97d9de78953c5b6ed8107",
      "duration_seconds": 10.739,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 43,
      "unit_id": "N043",
      "paragraph_id": "P17",
      "source_text": "一个项目每三天就和其他方向重新竞价，团队、能力和方法都来不及沉淀。可如果十年都拒绝根据事实复盘，承诺又会变成拒绝更新的理由。",
      "source_text_sha256": "7eee9a7f6a53a3695dd26571816b16bd2e80853b6281ad6ce50f856c00909e2c",
      "character_count": 62,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N043-42496c91-21e3-4c35-8b54-08d3ed571a70.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b0e1a08444c31ad1cb3d0cd579ee9da269fd24cbd1653703e81e0390dff48c35",
      "duration_seconds": 13.653,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 44,
      "unit_id": "N044",
      "paragraph_id": "P18",
      "source_text": "比较成熟的节奏，是前期探索，找到一个足够好的方向，然后承诺并执行；平时不反复重开选择，到了固定节点再复盘，重大事实变化时重新定价。",
      "source_text_sha256": "226c286d6bbd041314144f1fd80097ef34d7610f26d86df8e204c89f667b5f4f",
      "character_count": 65,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N044-f11ed972-d427-4708-a17a-18891799a53a.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "14af443967c1621b7949e146845305ca67897f9b7a40bf287c1fa66ec9f040a6",
      "duration_seconds": 16.338,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 45,
      "unit_id": "N045",
      "paragraph_id": "P18",
      "source_text": "广度来自保持选择权，深度来自主动关闭选择权。关键不在于永远开门或永远关门，而在于知道哪些门保护自由，哪些门若一直开着，会让投入永远停留在试用期。",
      "source_text_sha256": "a89a28709d06ce6e64a59d4dc6e2f17deaf580ddb9472a5fdfaf057ea53bcade",
      "character_count": 72,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N045-f885afc8-e9c1-4274-8f6b-9f6257d8958a.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "9d69389f9cedc170aa2996b49f8b790dfd467d6a794507b619f5db4f5d4ff634",
      "duration_seconds": 16.86,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 46,
      "unit_id": "N046",
      "paragraph_id": "P19",
      "source_text": "承诺不是确信当前选择是宇宙最优。我们不可能先活完所有路线，再回来挑最高分。",
      "source_text_sha256": "18d3c5432133027dc9208d1374f145db0f00dfe5687993125dbaf30783558972",
      "character_count": 37,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N046-7bec1040-d707-48d5-8463-c8ec3354dc51.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "01a861170196a859b74d7a46b074a20a9afeb2ddf75926921af7a0bea361b4a9",
      "duration_seconds": 8.905,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 47,
      "unit_id": "N047",
      "paragraph_id": "P19",
      "source_text": "承诺更像是：在没有出现足以推翻它的新信息以前，暂时停止反复竞价，让时间、能力和关系产生深度。同时，它必须拥有破约条件；",
      "source_text_sha256": "a9316fb7dc0a46357a38efbbaa9d124be012646753f41c286cf39da3f9666475",
      "character_count": 59,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N047-331a636d-0f11-4879-8ea5-e2fc0f80951e.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "6e4e32e6a7fac24d45e51cc8984c3578e50f882d63ce869b9efb44b85697865f",
      "duration_seconds": 13.711,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 48,
      "unit_id": "N048",
      "paragraph_id": "P19",
      "source_text": "目标失去价值、路径证据崩塌或成本越过边界时，就应重新判断。否则承诺会再次退化为沉没成本。",
      "source_text_sha256": "f463c16cf19097d0b28096533ea71582184e7c0d8786df82c575c071f6fe2f62",
      "character_count": 44,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N048-3d767a41-945f-43b8-ad90-2db54834af4c.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "38de919fe1daabc5124e466faedbad0c3a37d06ca216c159c20e64f4266dab30",
      "duration_seconds": 9.276,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 49,
      "unit_id": "N049",
      "paragraph_id": "P19",
      "source_text": "那么，下一次面对昂贵选择时，具体可以怎样检查？",
      "source_text_sha256": "beff244638efc30325f99368f90fac8759b06d6e877d0e3c4a266a7aee42da30",
      "character_count": 23,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N049-4a70a6fe-7a25-4375-a015-633bddf52c27.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "5aa7f65da7fedbab8a9dbec397590b9018167ae0745a59a955dedfc96b32a29e",
      "duration_seconds": 5.805,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 50,
      "unit_id": "N050",
      "paragraph_id": "P20",
      "source_text": "可以先问，我真正购买的是什么，是结果和体验，还是身份、比较与逃避？再问真实价格，不只看钱，也看时间、注意力、健康、关系，以及因此放弃的其他可能。",
      "source_text_sha256": "22c7fe75f1d5627e598e0202644ffa9be96b114d8725c3ebdfa18ad7487f4600",
      "character_count": 72,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N050-87602e37-c99f-404f-abf5-7608d9856d4d.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b4de191bc4fc00b249f994ef55a25f30653581121269c8b7a3665492f682ed04",
      "duration_seconds": 15.363,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 51,
      "unit_id": "N051",
      "paragraph_id": "P20",
      "source_text": "然后判断它在时间里怎样变化：会复利，会计息，还是正在过期？",
      "source_text_sha256": "acd147b60f7ac9af8a02c50af12072d765188ae5dbc6d9e66ae614b085899d6b",
      "character_count": 29,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N051-aa5882ef-0be4-4959-99dc-08448c8bfac7.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7353a84b472751633c9ceeea1025dbeaf5623994675a1b2f534b0630a0d25f22",
      "duration_seconds": 6.989,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 52,
      "unit_id": "N052",
      "paragraph_id": "P21",
      "source_text": "接着，把已经支付的成本拿出投票席，只看下一单位投入，我还愿意买吗？最后把视线放远：这个决定会把什么代价留给未来的我，又转移给其他人？",
      "source_text_sha256": "0bfd9ea4b7a64e2cbc3907de97a429b1222688e9b6e924c7138bac185015a5d2",
      "character_count": 66,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N052-4120cc2a-c3f4-4634-861d-7d06a0e45ed0.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4f6c3e99cab932f1f4cebc30e03ef2175d710d0f166632757215674391231e9a",
      "duration_seconds": 14.55,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 53,
      "unit_id": "N053",
      "paragraph_id": "P21",
      "source_text": "五个问题不能消除不确定，却能让购买对象、时间性质和承担者同时出现在桌面上。",
      "source_text_sha256": "cacb8fcdac42a4f91ccd40dea21e3b64465d0a3066e27c9e2e42aecefc11d3e4",
      "character_count": 37,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N053-39cbfc47-f3b0-431a-9705-4175d6374e0a.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "616314fb297ab3ae2097c9df2ca69fa1ed0892a5d6b20b0093708359da37821c",
      "duration_seconds": 8.742,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 54,
      "unit_id": "N054",
      "paragraph_id": "P22",
      "source_text": "这不是要求每天重新审判人生。只有当选择代价很高、难以逆转，会长期影响身体和关系、锁死未来路径，或把重大成本推给别人时，才值得完整审计。",
      "source_text_sha256": "184dbe26126de383c29d484d4ac4a76da898eeabe131923b13cd2ab7295008ba",
      "character_count": 67,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N054-e78a77f7-2f8d-4938-8ebf-ac717acbdf24.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "98209ddc7ce3978cc240d6ce1d6b1aa6ba7ad86d851209c79243ba12e064715d",
      "duration_seconds": 15.386,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 55,
      "unit_id": "N055",
      "paragraph_id": "P22",
      "source_text": "普通小事交给习惯、默认值和已有边界。框架的目的，是降低决策摩擦，不是让生活每天召开伦理委员会。",
      "source_text_sha256": "3c7ed337097c8febbac7f9223f1f0eb0fd7f8e3eed456d1acc468c0b35146e8f",
      "character_count": 47,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N055-23783f0d-9c1d-4260-bcdf-5762647665b0.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "27566eab7029555efdbb6a3ae8993acaf9ecad836af04db4d79289ccacc3f63b",
      "duration_seconds": 9.834,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 56,
      "unit_id": "N056",
      "paragraph_id": "P22",
      "source_text": "它只能摆出价格，真正拥有执行权的仍是现在。",
      "source_text_sha256": "dce0e9e884c4d35f47a0781db6d66ebee4ad3f39c4bec91d6d91f0906576a5f9",
      "character_count": 21,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N056-841816ca-4e02-495a-8674-9e1f380114d6.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e733867faf9cdbe0d418ade683bbb2577990e2b5550d847917cc6365e88dbe27",
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 57,
      "unit_id": "N057",
      "paragraph_id": "P23",
      "source_text": "过去提供信息，未来提供约束，现在拥有执行权。过去不能绑架今天，未来不能吞掉今天，今天也不能把账单全扔给以后。",
      "source_text_sha256": "1cc6d4b8f1b6c628beca2b1e5cbb7a62be0c1defbc2ed7c7491899d8de7cd556",
      "character_count": 54,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N057-22dc8a93-4a6e-4543-bbff-8b9d63011278.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "20d03753ddec6c0ffc776c42a2137e0aaa5a7d6352af16c7807103a5e99b7c96",
      "duration_seconds": 11.378,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 58,
      "unit_id": "N058",
      "paragraph_id": "P23",
      "source_text": "好人生不要求无痛、无悔或每一步绝对正确。有些遗憾只是有限性的价格，会失去的东西仍值得认真拥有。",
      "source_text_sha256": "fcf680b5f3a047b50530b0e5cfc766073d8f1804771d6bf61696bfdf1069dc1b",
      "character_count": 47,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N058-c4910131-b4b0-4465-8d1f-3725c0d371d9.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "533a895639746e3aa304478cd79680e358f7d5f02e3f7eb6205fb8d91a0de337",
      "duration_seconds": 9.834,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 59,
      "unit_id": "N059",
      "paragraph_id": "P24",
      "source_text": "我们能做的，是减少那些清醒后仍不愿认领的损耗，选择值得承担的痛苦。在理解价格和边界以后，建立一条自己仍愿意认领的生命轨迹。",
      "source_text_sha256": "e55268ae5af4b8dcb27d992b44c8be1387c7035ba281bb40e08725badfca1e25",
      "character_count": 61,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N059-c698b2a0-5f08-4b6e-866f-c8ea4731ee06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "58d3b7197f540feb9610f8ed09da450b11c4b6535dc33bb5eec708899936e06d",
      "duration_seconds": 12.736,
      "retry_count": 0
    },
    {
      "segment_index": 60,
      "unit_id": "N060",
      "paragraph_id": "P24",
      "source_text": "从现在开始，下一单位生命，准备分配到哪里？",
      "source_text_sha256": "d6ecfddccbc9055989d99cf1372a54d6365207bc9bdef836bedd583e716f10b4",
      "character_count": 21,
      "provider": "indextts2",
      "voice": "xlbnas@1",
      "status": "succeeded",
      "audio_artifact": "projects/75c6255a-4826-49eb-98d4-bd092df03657/audio/units/1/N060-0118856d-7292-426d-ac25-33492a719452.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "936ea8c8595e3b7cb70186239af90456ead5fc992056d742ca24c5e9fe458804",
      "duration_seconds": 5.062,
      "retry_count": 0
    }
  ]
}
